Title: gaze loses every external seat on a PR outside the harness
Created: 2026-09-16
Author: claude
Closed: 2026-09-16 fixed in the same PR

--- log ---
2026-09-16T11:50Z claude created
2026-09-16T11:50Z claude note Found by a /gaze run on a git-erg PR that lost all three seats. Two independent causes; this is the one that is ours to fix. The other is a dead credential (see body).
